Subject: [PATCH 210/220] [ae-patch] Show a session's questions and prompts in
 its lead's action dock

A family child is a top-level session labelled ae.orch with its lead's id, so the sub-agent mirror (parent_conversation_id only) never reached the lead. The server now also mirrors a child's elicitation request and resolved signal into its lead's stream and adds its pending prompts to the lead's snapshot, marked with the child's title. The lead's transcript skips those blocks; the action dock lists them and renders each real approval card, which resolves in the child through the existing resolve route. Two settings rows in Settings > General > Sessions (child_prompts, child_relay on the user's roles) switch the mirror and the lead's relay tool.
